Found on k253 (2026-11-19, ack-paket, a4cbd48). k253 makes bin/skilletor-start take SKILLETOR_BINARY_BASE_URL only as https:// outside SKILLETOR_STARTER_TESTING=1, but download() runs curl -L / wget with their default redirect protocols, so an https URL that redirects to http:// is fetched in plaintext. briefing's starter pins both outside testing: curl --proto '=https' --proto-redir '=https', and a check of wget's redirect chain (its test test_wget_rejects_https_to_http_redirect). The pinned checksum still guards the bytes. Done when skilletor pins redirects to https outside the test gate as briefing does (or says why not), with a test for curl and wget.
